-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §99: the existing first deputy's personal
-- percentage supplement, as §72's — T without the education allowance; B =
-- T × (100 + Y)%; C as a percentage of the combined salary; not
-- pensionable; contributions under the Dafna agreement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `72`
IMPORT `97`

§ `99`

-- akn:art_99 The heading line: the personal percentage supplement of an existing first deputy.

-- (א) ¶1–¶8: T, the whole position's March pay without the education
-- allowance, refunds, yearly payments, gross-up and benefit (the months as
-- in §72); B and C as there, Y being 20%.
@ref akn:art_99__para_a akn:art_99__para_a/p2 akn:art_99__para_a/p3 akn:art_99__para_a/p4 akn:art_99__para_a/p5 akn:art_99__para_a/p6 akn:art_99__para_a/p7 akn:art_99__para_a/p8
GIVEN t IS A NUMBER, `new table pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's supplement rate` t `new table pay` IS
    `the personal supplement rate` t `a first deputy's conversion coefficient` `new table pay`

-- (ב): not pensionable.
@ref akn:art_99__para_b
`the first deputy's personal supplement is pensionable` MEANS FALSE

-- (ג): "בגין התגמול כאמור בפסקה (3)", which §99 does not have
-- (F-ofek-hadash-base-99-a, as F-ofek-hadash-base-72-a); read as the
-- personal supplement (convention reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_99__para_c
`the employer's contribution on the first deputy's supplement` MEANS 40/3 DIVIDED BY 100

`the numbered paragraphs of §99` MEANS LIST "(א)", "(ב)", "(ג)", "(ד)"
`99(ג) cites a paragraph (3) §99 does not have` MEANS
    NOT elem "(3)" `the numbered paragraphs of §99`
#ASSERT `99(ג) cites a paragraph (3) §99 does not have`

-- akn:art_99__para_d The undertaking to negotiate a clarification of section 3.ה of the agreement of 27.12.84; no rule.

-- T = 12,000, table 13,500: B = 14,400, C = 900, 6⅔%.
#ASSERT `a first deputy's supplement rate` 12000 13500 TIMES 13500 EQUALS 900
